sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as 用户
    participant M as MetricsPage
    participant H as useDashboardOverview
    participant API as http.getDashboardOverview
    participant S as dashboard.service
    participant A as portfolioAgg

    U->>M: 打开 /metrics
    M->>H: 挂载 useDashboardOverview()
    H->>API: GET /api/dashboard/overview?scope=...&health=...
    API->>S: getDashboardOverview(db, query, me)
    S->>S: listScopedItems(db, q, me, scope)
    S->>S: listScopeAllLeafTasks(db, projectIds)  // 全量叶子（含已完成）
    S->>S: tasks = allLeafTasks.filter(status !== '完成')
    S->>A: aggregateHealth(items)
    S->>A: aggregateStatusDonut(items)
    S->>A: aggregatePriorityDist(tasks)          // 新增
    S->>A: aggregateStatusDist(allLeafTasks)     // 新增
    S->>A: aggregateOverdueDuration(tasks, todayStr) // 新增
    S->>A: aggregateOverdue / aggregateOwnerLoad / countOverdueTasks
    S-->>API: { stats, statusDonut, health, priorityDist, statusDist, overdueDuration, overdue, ownerLoad, reportMissing, projects }
    API-->>H: DashboardOverview
    H-->>M: data / loading / error
    M->>M: 渲染 7 图（② HealthDonut · ⑤⑥⑦ CategoryBarChart）
    Note over M: ② 健康环下钻（B12 行为不变）
    M->>M: onDrill(health) → setQuery({ health: toggle })
    M->>H: query 变化 → 重新请求 → 7 图刷新
